# MLflow tracking store + artifact store -- both fully regenerated by
# `python scripts/train_risk_model.py` (also runs as a CI smoke test), and
# mlruns/ in particular duplicates a model file per run (~39MB for one sweep,
# grows every time the script is re-run) -- not something to version.
mlflow.db
mlflow.db-*
mlruns/
mlruns_tmp/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
